{"about_the_game":"<strong><i>Backwater Eulogy</i></strong> is a stream of consciousness, autobiographical exploration of loss and the double-sided nature of grief. Told as a linear narrative, there are no choices, and there are no alternate endings. Sit and stay for a moment, before leaving.<br><br>Taking the form of a short visual novel, this is a short story of sorts about grief, moving on, and life in the rural Midwest. As a &quot;kinetic novel&quot; there are no alternative routes or choices- just one storyline to follow to its inevitable conclusion. Placing an emphasis on a small, curated experience, it is best experienced in one sitting. <br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2000+ words (10-15 minute run time)<br></li><li>10+ panels of highly rendered, hand-pixeled scenery<br></li><li>Hand-animated elements</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134050/extras/deer_steampage.gif?t=1724690348\" /><br><i>CW: Contains mentions of animal death.</i>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3134050?t=1724690348","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3134050?t=1724690348","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134050/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1724690348","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134050/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1724690348","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong><i>Backwater Eulogy</i></strong> is a stream of consciousness, autobiographical exploration of loss and the double-sided nature of grief. Told as a linear narrative, there are no choices, and there are no alternate endings. Sit and stay for a moment, before leaving.<br><br>Taking the form of a short vi